<div class="section height--normal align--middle color--default"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image"><div><div><div><div class="flexcard flexcard-card flexcard-size--normal flexcard-media-right valign-center align-left"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-original" href="#septim-funkce" style="padding-bottom:76.92307692307693%"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width:1390px) 695px, (min-width:720px) 50.00vw, 100.00vw" src="/files/r/1280/funkce-pokladna-hdr.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/funkce-pokladna-hdr.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/funkce-pokladna-hdr.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/funkce-pokladna-hdr.webp 1920w"/></a></div></div><div class="flexcard-content"><div class="flexcard-content-wrapper"><div class="text-block"><h2>Co je Pokladna v systému Septim?</h2>
<p></p>
<p>Pokladna je základní produkt <a href="/pokladni-provozni-system-pro-restaurace">provozního systému Septim</a>. V pokladně obsluha provádí veškeré běžné kroky, které souvisí s obsloužením hosta. Klíčové je, že je pokladna uživatelsky jednoduchá a jak promyšleně jsou na ní napojeny další části Septimu.</p>
</div><div class="image-btn"><a class="btn btn-default" href="#septim-funkce"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">Jak funguje Pokladna v restauraci?</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section height--normal align--middle color--default no-pb section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h2 class="center">Respektované provozy, které používají Septim Pokladnu<span class="text-highlight">.</span></h2>
</div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-gallery grid-sm-2"><div><div><div><div class="grid gallery-container" style="--gap:40px"><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Zátiší Group" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-zatisi-group.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Field" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-field.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Entrée" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-entree.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Kolkovna" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-kolkovna.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Pizza Coloseum" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-pizza-coloseum.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/chci-septim"><img alt="Vaše logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-vase.svg"/></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(240, 252, 255)"></div></div>
